        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "(The car stops. Paranthaman and Punyakodi get down.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "Come! Come inside.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "You conducted the wedding very economically, didn't you....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "Yes.... (turning inside) Radha, Radha, come here for a moment.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u005",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Radha comes and stands there; indicating her.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "This is....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh... Pandiyan has a younger sister too?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "Younger sister! She's his stepmother! My wife...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh... is that so....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u010",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d008",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Silly laugh) Radha! If there's tea or coffee, bring something quickly...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u011",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Radha goes inside.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u012",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d009",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 64,
            "printedPage": 56
          }
        ],
        "text": "A girl worth her weight in gold! Only one defect—she is mute! She's somewhat educated...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u013",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d010",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "Can she sing?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u014",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d011",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "How can she sing, brother? I'm telling you she's mute...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u015",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d012",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh! Does a cuckoo call by speaking words? It makes some sound; even that they call the cuckoo singing.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u016",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d013",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "Hee, hee, hee... yes... yes. You said that very well.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u017",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Radha comes to the table with coffee.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u018",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d014",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "At this old age, marrying is so that you can have her cook for you and eat, have her sing music and enjoy it, isn't it?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u019",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d015",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "You know how it is. All my time is spent labouring for that wretched mill.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u020",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d016",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "Poor thing... and at this old age too...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u021",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d017",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "What, brother, why do you keep saying I've grown old?... (taking the coffee from Radha) Brother, you've made plans for how the workers' matter should proceed, haven't you?... Don't forget it...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u022",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "(They drink coffee.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u023",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d018",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "Would I forget? I will never forget. This Paranthaman has never left unfinished what he set his mind on....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u024",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d019",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "I was wondering where you might leave it unfinished.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s049-u025",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s049-d020",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 65,
            "printedPage": 57
          }
        ],
        "text": "Then I'll be going...",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
